@startuml
title Activity 25 - Admin Reviews Feedback

|Admin|
start
:Open Feedback Management;
|Frontend|
:GET feedback records;
|Backend|
:Authenticate Admin role;
if (Admin authorized?) then (yes)
  :Return feedback and submitter details;
  |Admin|
  :Filter by type, rating or status;
  :Open feedback detail;
  :Add review note or change review status;
  |Frontend|
  :Validate review update;
  :PATCH feedback review;
  |Backend|
  :Persist Admin review state;
  :Write audit event;
  |Frontend|
  :Refresh feedback list;
  stop
else (no)
  :Return 403;
  |Frontend|
  :Hide management page;
  stop
endif
@enduml
